<blockquote>
<p>She disliked hospitals, the ward she sat in was almost blindingly white, sterile and only occupied by her, the interviewer, and four other victims of the attack.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I don't like the comma spam here. This can be like 3 sentences.</p>
